items.description:
Configuration for a single plugin entry.

Can be either a plain path string or an object with path and options:

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    "simple-plugin.grit",
    { "path": "scoped-plugin.grit", "includes": ["src/**/*.ts"] }
  ]
}
```

